        "text_HkWPb8": {
          "type": "block--text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Hey there, you fabulous human! Are you tired of missing out on the latest and greatest from the land of Grunt Style? (You know, the place where patriotic apparel meets pure awesomeness?) Well, fret no more! We've got a little secret to share that’ll make you feel like the VIP you truly are!</p>",
            "size": "body",
            "alignment": "inherit",
            "color": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "text_hCJW6r": {
          "type": "block--text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Introducing our VIP Text Message Alerts! (Cue the confetti and jazz hands!) This is your golden ticket to stay in the know about all things Grunt Style. Imagine receiving exclusive updates, sneak peeks, and maybe even a few surprises right in your pocket. It’s like having a personal assistant, but way cooler and without the awkward small talk at the water cooler.</p>",
            "size": "body",
            "alignment": "inherit",
            "color": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
